| `GND` | U1.GND, U2.5, U4.4, U5.2, U6.GND, J1.A1, J1.B1, J1.A12, J1.B12, D1.3, R1.2, R2.2, R3.2, SW1.2, LED1.GND, XU7.VSS, XU7.VSSQ, BT1.2 |
| `I2C_SCL` | U1.I2C_SCL, R5.1 |
| `I2C_SDA` | U1.I2C_SDA, R4.1 |
| `PROG` | U3.5, R3.1 |
